        <p class="hint">支持 ${_d(a0_0x59aa0d(0x172,'\x66\x4f\x63\x29')+a0_0x59aa0d(0x1bef,'\x4c\x64\x26\x67'))}://（可带 user:pass@）、http(s)://、${_d(a0_0x59aa0d(0x3a6c,'\x6f\x35\x5d\x66')+a0_0x59aa0d(0x29ec,'\x5e\x74\x7a\x6b'))} 或 host:port（默认按 ${_d(a0_0x59aa0d(0x2d1f,'\x59\x2a\x42\x28')+a0_0x59aa0d(0x2b26,'\x75\x73\x38\x69'))}，端口 1080）。此项控制 Worker 的真实转发出口，不会作为节点字段写进订阅；验证出口 IP 时请选择“仅走出口（only）”，默认模式在代理失败时会回退直连。SS 加密支持 ${_d(a0_0x59aa0d(0x273a,'\x5b\x72\x40\x37')+a0_0x59aa0d(0x37b,'\x50\x42\x68\x26')+a0_0x59aa0d(0x2a7b,'\x44\x76\x41\x55')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x59aa0d(0x3121,'\x2a\x30\x32\x71')+'\x54\x49\x31\x4e\x69'+a0_0x59aa0d(0xd6f,'\x76\x32\x42\x24')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x59aa0d(0x39cc,'\x71\x44\x43\x34')+a0_0x59aa0d(0x3b4f,'\x50\x42\x68\x26')+'\x41\x3d')}-ietf-poly1305。</p>
